              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Icite 35:9-11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo uyo muntu asosa ati, “Nomba tawakulaitwa ishina lya Yakobo, lelo Israeli,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32:28",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Israeli:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Mu Cihibulu calola mukuti alwishanya na Lesa.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " pantu naulwishanyana na Lesa na bantu, kabili naubansha.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JDG.13.17+JDG.13.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Abap 13:17-18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakobo amweba ati, “Napapata njebako ishina lyobe.” Nao amwasuka ati, “Cinshi uleipushisha ishina lyandi?” Awe apopene apaala na Yakobo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
